<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Hershey upgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Hershey upgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Goldman Sachs said that analyst Nomi Ghez upgraded Hershey Foods Corp to the recommended list from a rating of market perform.</p>
<p>-- further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Hershey stock traded at 47-5/8 in morning trade, up two points from Friday's close.</p>
